usage: ladon theorem plan [-h] [--repo-root REPO_ROOT] [--format {text,json}]
                          [--output OUTPUT] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                          [--max-rss-mib MAX_RSS_MIB]
                          theorem

positional arguments:
  theorem               Fully qualified Lean theorem name.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo-root REPO_ROOT
                        Lean repository containing the theorem.
  --format {text,json}  Result representation.
  --output OUTPUT       Result path, or - for standard output.
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Finite deadline for each target Lean/Lake process.
  --max-rss-mib MAX_RSS_MIB
                        Optional supported process-tree resident-memory limit
                        in MiB.
